[{"client_msg_id":"1e530af0-5b1f-4f03-b54f-83e877e20f89","type":"message","user":"US90LD360","text":"あれ。。いったんgit resetしてやってみたらうまくgenerateで更新できました！なんか変な変更が入ってたのかもしれないです。\nお騒がせしました:bow:","ts":"1627457993.005200","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"+1","count":1,"users":["U06BRP8VD"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Mqzv9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b5c99c24-c9f0-4d74-8b0d-3150d01ab809","type":"message","user":"US90LD360","text":"あーたしかに。最小構成でmain.goだけで試してみたらうまく動きましたね。。\nなんで動かないんだろ。もうちょっと調べてみます。","ts":"1627456103.003900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"KzW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"18abfd53-8767-4711-96f8-5baa4032a0b2","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"pwdが違うとかそういう細かな前提条件が違うんじゃないかな","ts":"1627455739.003100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9plNn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0a7e1124-8a3e-4c5f-b8e8-65be237f4955","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"go generateがやるのは `go:generate` 探してその後ろのコマンド実行するだけだから。","ts":"1627455716.002500","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["US90LD360"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Dlx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"987600f8-f9e3-41bf-94c4-5213ed060fe9","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"\u0026gt; methodチェックしてるのはgo generateだと思っています\n詳細は分からないけども、これだけは明らかに間違いですよ。","ts":"1627455689.002000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xZBDC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e9fef0e4-97b8-4f90-b95a-da5eadd54b47","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"いやそれもおかしいか","ts":"1627455616.001400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cSA="}]},{"client_msg_id":"66d5f274-de02-4916-a724-9333b94ebb2c","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"goimportsじゃないの","ts":"1627455608.001100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6DBW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f11c1c4c-04a9-43a0-a203-b44aed69521b","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"んーそんなことある?","ts":"1627455602.000900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9vV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"558f0ce7-b230-4472-bed1-d555085d307b","type":"message","user":"US90LD360","text":"go generateでmatryer/moqのmockファイルを生成、更新したいんですが、例えば本体のinterfaceにメソッドを追加したときにgo generateすると生成されたmock ファイルが古くなってて `missing method` エラーでgo generateが失敗してしまいます。\n```//go:generate moq -fmt goimports -rm -out=myinterface_test.moq.go . MyInterface```\nなにかいい方法ありますかね？古くなってinterfaceを満たさなくなった生成ファイルは無視してほしいんですが。。\nちなみにgenerateで実行する↑のコマンドを単体で実行するとエラーにならないのでmethodチェックしてるのはgo generateだと思っています。","ts":"1627455327.000600","edited":{"user":"US90LD360","ts":"1627455499.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BKZu"}]}]
